Payloads
--------
Every prompt-injection payload shipped with tracebait is original work written for
this project. No payload text is copied from papers, datasets or other tools.

Third-party data
----------------
Incident packs under src/tracebait/data/packs/ contain small, attributed slices of public
security datasets. Each pack also records its sources' archive URLs and SHA-256 digests,
and scripts/build_packs.py rebuilds it from them. Selected records are kept verbatim
except that the rendered Message field is removed and numbers are written as strings.

